.SS NAME
.IP
.EX
rtcTraversableIntersect1 \- finds the closest hit for a single ray
.EE
.SS SYNOPSIS
.IP
.EX
#include <embree4/rtcore.h>

void rtcTraversableIntersect1(
  RTCTraversable traversable,
  struct RTCRayHit* rayhit
  struct RTCIntersectArguments* args = NULL
);
.EE
.SS DESCRIPTION
The \f[CR]rtcTraversableIntersect\f[R] function is equivalent to
\f[CR]rtcIntersect1\f[R] but takes traversable object
(\f[CR]traversable\f[R] argument) instead of a scene object.
Using this method is optional on CPU but it is required for SYCL.
.PP
For more details, refer to the documentation of
\f[CR]rtcIntersect1\f[R].
.SS EXIT STATUS
For performance reasons this function does not do any error checks, thus
will not set any error flags on failure.
